+## Legacy export metadata completion
+
+When delayed scoring encounters incomplete legacy export metadata, keep the original
+program, stage, predictions and controller receipts immutable. A successor scored
+protocol still points to native_stage_program_ref and exact native_stage_exports.
+The matcher permits only directional completion of a manifest: preserve every old
